# Backend

- The backend is Go.
- Serve HTTP with the Go standard library. Add a web framework only after a later rule chooses one.
- Handle requests in parallel.
- Open SQLite with modernc.org/sqlite. Listen on port 8080 inside the Docker network.
- A phone and an email follow the frontend input rule. Refuse a value that rule rejects. A customer phone is required, and that stored phone belongs to one customer. An empty email stays allowed.
